    "All heats of formation must be standard values measured under the same reference conditions (typically 25°C, 1 atm), with coefficients from a correctly balanced equation. This simplified form supports up to two reactants and two products; reactions with more species require summing additional terms externally.": "所有生成热必须是在相同参比条件下（通常为 25°C、1 atm）测得的标准值，系数须来自配平正确的化学方程式。此简化形式最多支持两种反应物和两种生成物；涉及更多物种的反应需要在外部另行加总其他项。",
