    "Filtration Fraction (GFR / Renal Plasma Flow)": "滤过分数（GFR / 肾血浆流量）",
    "First Law of Thermodynamics (Change in Internal Energy)": "热力学第一定律（内能变化）",
    "First term of difference sequence": "差数列的首项",
    "First term of original sequence": "原数列的首项",
    "Freezing point depression": "凝固点降低",
    "Frequency of O blood type phenotype": "O 型血表现型频率",
    "Frequency of allele A": "A 等位基因频率",
    "Frequency of allele O": "O 等位基因频率",
    "Gas Pressure from Kinetic Theory (Molecular Model)": "由气体动理论（分子模型）求气体压强",
    "Gives the molar heat capacity at constant pressure for a monatomic ideal gas, equal to the constant-volume heat capacity plus the gas constant R (Mayer's relation). It represents the heat required to raise the temperature of one mole of gas by one kelvin at constant pressure, including the work of expansion.": "给出单原子理想气体的定压摩尔热容，等于定容热容加上气体常数 R（迈耶关系）。它表示在恒压下将 1 摩尔气体升温 1 开尔文所需的热量，其中包含膨胀所做的功。",
    "Gives the molar heat capacity at constant volume for a monatomic ideal gas, derived from the equipartition theorem applied to the three translational degrees of freedom. It represents the heat required to raise the temperature of one mole of gas by one kelvin at constant volume.": "给出单原子理想气体的定容摩尔热容，由能量均分定理应用于三个平动自由度推导而来。它表示在恒容下将 1 摩尔气体升温 1 开尔文所需的热量。",
    "Glomerular filtration rate": "肾小球滤过率",
    "Glomerular filtration rate (from inulin clearance)": "肾小球滤过率（由菊粉清除率计算）",
    "Goldman-Hodgkin-Katz Equation (Resting Membrane Potential)": "戈德曼-霍奇金-卡茨方程（静息膜电位）",
    "Heat added to the gas": "气体吸收的热量",
    "Heavier mass": "较重质量",
    "Here a is the astroid parameter satisfying x^(2/3) + y^(2/3) = a^(2/3), equal to the radius of the fixed outer circle; a must be positive.": "此处 a 为满足 x^(2/3) + y^(2/3) = a^(2/3) 的星形线参数，等于固定外圆的半径；a 必须为正值。",
    "Here a is the same astroid parameter used in the enclosed-area formula; a must be positive.": "此处 a 与所围面积公式中所用的星形线参数相同；a 必须为正值。",
    "Hydrogen Mass Percent (Combustion Analysis)": "氢的质量分数（燃烧分析法）",
    "Hydrogen mass percent": "氢的质量分数",
    "Hyperbola Eccentricity": "双曲线离心率",
    "Imaginary semi-axis b": "虚半轴 b",
    "Initial horizontal velocity": "初始水平速度",
