    "Intracellular Na+ concentration": "细胞内 Na+ 浓度",
    "Iodine Value": "碘值",
    "Isobaric (Constant-Pressure) Work Done by an Ideal Gas": "理想气体的等压（定压）功",
    "Just-noticeable difference in stimulus": "刺激的最小可觉差",
    "Kinetic Energy Lost in a Perfectly Inelastic Collision": "完全非弹性碰撞中损失的动能",
