    "Modular Exponentiation a^b mod n": "模幂运算 a^b mod n",
    "Computes a^b mod n exactly by repeated squaring, without ever forming the huge power a^b — the core operation of RSA and Diffie–Hellman.": "通过反复平方精确计算 a^b mod n，而无需求出巨大的幂 a^b——这是 RSA 和 Diffie–Hellman 的核心运算。",
    "Exact for any size of a and b (n up to about 9 × 10^15). 7^40 mod 13 = 9. A negative exponent uses the modular inverse of a. RSA encrypts with c = m^e mod n and decrypts with m = c^d mod n.": "对任意大小的 a 和 b 均精确（n 最大约为 9 × 10^15）。7^40 mod 13 = 9。指数为负时使用 a 的模逆元。RSA 以 c = m^e mod n 加密，以 m = c^d mod n 解密。",
    "Primality Test": "素性检验",
    "Returns 1 if n is a prime number and 0 otherwise. The test is exact (deterministic Miller–Rabin) for every integer the app can hold.": "若 n 为素数则返回 1，否则返回 0。对本应用可表示的所有整数，该检验都是精确的（确定性 Miller–Rabin 检验）。",
    "Negative numbers, 0 and 1 are not prime. 2147483647 = 2^31 − 1 is a Mersenne prime.": "负数、0 和 1 都不是素数。2147483647 = 2^31 − 1 是梅森素数。",
