    "n must be at least 3. The largest prime below one million is 999,983.": "n 必须至少为 3。小于一百万的最大素数是 999,983。",
    "Prime-Counting Function π(x)": "素数计数函数 π(x)",
    "Counts the primes less than or equal to x exactly, using the Lucy–Hedgehog (Legendre-type) method.": "使用 Lucy–Hedgehog（勒让德型）方法，精确统计小于或等于 x 的素数个数。",
    "Exact for x up to 10^11. π(10^6) = 78,498.": "x 不超过 10^11 时精确。π(10^6) = 78,498。",
