    "Taylor exponent n": "Taylor 指数 n",
    "Turning Machining Time": "车削加工时间",
    "Gives the time for one turning pass along a length.": "求沿某一长度车削一刀所需的时间。",
    "Add approach and overrun distances to the length.": "长度中应加上切入和切出距离。",
    "Length of cut": "切削长度",
    "Tap Drill Size (Metric Thread)": "攻丝底孔直径（公制螺纹）",
    "Gives the drill size for cutting an ISO metric internal thread with about 75 % thread engagement.": "求加工螺纹啮合率约 75% 的 ISO 公制内螺纹所用的钻头直径。",
    "M10 × 1.5 uses an 8.5 mm drill.": "M10 × 1.5 使用 8.5 mm 钻头。",
    "Pitch": "螺距",
    "Sheet Metal Bend Allowance": "钣金折弯余量",
    "Gives the length of the neutral axis through a bend, used to compute the flat blank size.": "求通过折弯处的中性层长度，用于计算展开尺寸。",
    "The K-factor (neutral-axis position) is about 0.3–0.5.": "K 因子（中性层位置）约为 0.3–0.5。",
    "Bend angle": "折弯角度",
    "Inside bend radius": "内侧折弯半径",
    "Sheet thickness": "板厚",
    "Blanking or Punching Force": "冲裁力",
    "Gives the press force needed to punch or blank a shape from sheet metal.": "求从板材上冲裁出某一形状所需的压力机力。",
    "Shear strength is about 0.8 × tensile strength for steel.": "钢的抗剪强度约为 0.8 × 抗拉强度。",
    "Cut perimeter": "冲裁周长",
    "Shear strength": "抗剪强度",
    "Injection Moulding Clamp Force": "注塑锁模力",
    "Estimates the clamp force a moulding machine needs to keep the mould closed against the melt pressure.": "估算注塑机为抵抗熔体压力而保持模具闭合所需的锁模力。",
    "Add a 10–20 % margin when choosing the machine.": "选择机器时应留出 10–20% 的余量。",
    "Projected area of the parts and runners": "制品和流道的投影面积",
    "Cavity pressure": "型腔压力",
    "Chvorinov's Rule (Solidification Time)": "Chvorinov 法则（凝固时间）",
    "Gives the time for a casting to solidify from its volume-to-surface ratio (Chvorinov 1940); risers must solidify last.": "由体积与表面积之比求铸件的凝固时间（Chvorinov 1940）；冒口必须最后凝固。",
    "Bulky shapes take much longer than thin ones of the same volume.": "相同体积下，厚实形状比薄形状所需时间长得多。",
    "Casting volume": "铸件体积",
    "Mould constant B": "铸型常数 B",
    "Arc Welding Heat Input": "电弧焊热输入",
    "Gives the heat put into the work per millimetre of weld, which controls cooling rate and weld properties.": "求每毫米焊缝输入工件的热量，它决定冷却速度和焊缝性能。",
    "Efficiency ≈ 0.8 for MIG/MAG and SMAW, 0.6 for TIG (ISO/TR 17671).": "MIG/MAG 和焊条电弧焊的效率约为 0.8，TIG 为 0.6（ISO/TR 17671）。",
    "Arc voltage": "电弧电压",
    "Travel speed": "焊接速度",
    "Theoretical Surface Roughness in Turning": "车削理论表面粗糙度",
    "Gives the ideal arithmetic roughness left by a round-nosed turning tool.": "求圆头车刀留下的理想算术平均粗糙度。",
    "Halving the feed quarters the roughness.": "进给量减半，粗糙度降为四分之一。",
    "Tool nose radius": "刀尖圆弧半径",
    "Tolerance Stack-Up (Root Sum Square)": "公差累积（平方和根）",
    "Gives the statistical tolerance of an assembly of parts in a chain, much tighter than the worst-case sum.": "求链式装配零件的统计公差，比最坏情况之和小得多。",
    "Assumes independent, centred, normally distributed dimensions.": "假设各尺寸相互独立、居中且服从正态分布。",
    "Tolerances of each part": "各零件的公差",
    "Hydraulic Motor Torque": "液压马达扭矩",
    "Gives the output torque of a hydraulic motor from its displacement and working pressure.": "由排量和工作压力求液压马达的输出扭矩。",
    "MPa × cm³ gives N·m directly.": "MPa × cm³ 直接得到 N·m。",
    "Displacement per revolution": "每转排量",
    "Hydraulic Pump Flow": "液压泵流量",
    "Gives the delivered flow of a positive-displacement pump.": "求容积式泵的输出流量。",
    "Volumetric efficiency falls as pressure rises (internal leakage).": "容积效率随压力升高而下降（内泄漏）。",
    "Shaft speed": "轴转速",
    "Volumetric efficiency": "容积效率",
    "Pneumatic Cylinder Air Consumption": "气缸耗气量",
    "Gives the free-air consumption of a single-acting pneumatic cylinder; double it for double-acting (ignoring the rod).": "求单作用气缸的自由空气消耗量；双作用则加倍（忽略活塞杆）。",
    "Used to size compressors.": "用于选定空压机。",
    "Strokes per minute": "每分钟行程数",
    "Gauge pressure": "表压",
    "Sensible Cooling or Heating Load of Air": "空气显热冷负荷或热负荷",
    "Gives the sensible heat carried by an airflow changing temperature (ρc_p ≈ 1.21 kJ/(m³·K) for air near room conditions).": "求温度变化的气流所携带的显热（室内条件附近的空气 ρc_p ≈ 1.21 kJ/(m³·K)）。",
    "Latent (moisture) load is added separately.": "潜热（湿负荷）另行加算。",
    "Latent Cooling Load of Air": "空气潜热冷负荷",
    "Gives the heat removed by condensing moisture out of an airflow (ρ·h_fg ≈ 3010 kJ/(m³ per kg/kg)).": "求从气流中凝结除湿所带走的热量（ρ·h_fg ≈ 3010 kJ/(m³ per kg/kg)）。",
    "Sensible + latent = total coil load.": "显热 + 潜热 = 盘管总负荷。",
    "Humidity ratio change": "含湿量变化",
    "Fan Shaft Power": "风机轴功率",
    "Gives the shaft power of a fan from its airflow, pressure rise and efficiency.": "由风量、压升和效率求风机的轴功率。",
    "Like pumps, fan power scales with the cube of speed.": "与泵一样，风机功率与转速的三次方成正比。",
    "Total pressure rise": "全压升",
    "Fan efficiency": "风机效率",
    "Refrigeration Capacity from Mass Flow and Enthalpy": "由质量流量和焓求制冷量",
    "Gives the cooling capacity of a vapour-compression cycle from the refrigerant flow and its enthalpy gain in the evaporator.": "由制冷剂流量及其在蒸发器中的焓增求蒸气压缩循环的制冷量。",
    "1 refrigeration ton = 3.517 kW.": "1 冷吨 = 3.517 kW。",
