    "Enthalpy leaving the evaporator": "蒸发器出口焓",
    "Enthalpy entering the evaporator": "蒸发器入口焓",
    "Effective Number of Bits (ENOB)": "有效位数（ENOB）",
    "Converts a converter's measured signal-to-noise-and-distortion ratio into the resolution of an ideal converter with the same performance.": "将转换器实测的信纳比换算为具有相同性能的理想转换器的分辨率。",
    "Real 16-bit ADCs often reach 13–14 effective bits.": "实际的 16 位 ADC 通常能达到 13–14 个有效位。",
    "Measured SINAD": "实测 SINAD",
    "Aliased Frequency": "混叠频率",
    "Gives the frequency at which a signal above the Nyquist limit appears after sampling.": "求高于奈奎斯特极限的信号在采样后出现的频率。",
    "A 7 kHz tone sampled at 10 kHz shows up at 3 kHz.": "以 10 kHz 采样的 7 kHz 音调会出现在 3 kHz 处。",
    "Signal frequency": "信号频率",
    "Sampling rate": "采样率",
    "DFT Frequency Resolution": "DFT 频率分辨率",
    "Gives the spacing between FFT bins: to see finer detail, record for longer.": "求 FFT 频点之间的间隔：要看到更精细的细节，需记录更长时间。",
    "4096 points at 48 kHz gives about 11.7 Hz bins.": "48 kHz 下 4096 点的频点间隔约为 11.7 Hz。",
    "FFT length": "FFT 长度",
    "Butterworth Filter Magnitude": "巴特沃斯滤波器幅值",
    "Gives the gain of an n-th order Butterworth low-pass filter: maximally flat, 0.707 at the cut-off, falling 20n dB per decade.": "求 n 阶巴特沃斯低通滤波器的增益：最大平坦，截止频率处为 0.707，每十倍频程下降 20n dB。",
    "One octave above the cut-off a 4th-order filter passes about 6 %.": "在截止频率以上一个倍频程处，4 阶滤波器约通过 6%。",
    "Cut-off frequency": "截止频率",
    "Filter order": "滤波器阶数",
