    "Trial number k": "试验序号 k",
    "Negative Binomial Probability": "负二项分布概率",
    "Gives the probability of exactly k failures before the r-th success.": "给出在第 r 次成功之前恰好失败 k 次的概率。",
    "Also used for over-dispersed counts in ecology and insurance.": "也用于生态学和保险中过度离散的计数。",
    "Failures before the r-th success": "第 r 次成功之前的失败次数",
    "Successes required r": "所需成功次数 r",
