    "Value x (0–1)": "值 x（0–1）",
    "Shape α": "形状 α",
    "Log-Normal Distribution Mean": "对数正态分布均值",
    "Gives the mean of a log-normal variable from the parameters of its logarithm; it exceeds the median e^μ.": "由其对数的参数给出对数正态变量的均值；它大于中位数 e^μ。",
    "Incomes, particle sizes and stock prices are roughly log-normal.": "收入、颗粒大小和股价大致服从对数正态分布。",
