    "Equivalent to Φ((ln x − μ)/σ).": "等价于 Φ((ln x − μ)/σ)。",
    "Triangular Distribution Mean": "三角分布均值",
    "Gives the mean of a triangular distribution, a common model for uncertain estimates with a minimum, most likely and maximum.": "给出三角分布的均值，这是用最小值、最可能值和最大值表示不确定估计的常用模型。",
    "Used in risk analysis and Monte Carlo cost models.": "用于风险分析和蒙特卡罗成本模型。",
