    "Approximates P(X ≤ k) for a large binomial with a normal curve, adding ½ for the continuity correction.": "用正态曲线近似大样本二项分布的 P(X ≤ k)，并加上 ½ 作为连续性校正。",
    "Good when np and n(1 − p) both exceed about 10.": "当 np 和 n(1 − p) 都超过约 10 时效果较好。",
