    "Hypothesis k": "假设 k",
    "Welch's t-Statistic": "Welch t 统计量",
    "Compares two means without assuming equal variances (Welch 1947); the default two-sample t-test in modern software.": "在不假设方差相等的情况下比较两个均值（Welch 1947）；是现代软件中默认的双样本 t 检验。",
    "Use the Welch–Satterthwaite degrees of freedom with it.": "需配合 Welch–Satterthwaite 自由度使用。",
    "SD of group 1": "第 1 组的标准差",
